# Web3Forms access key — free from https://web3forms.com
# Enquiries submitted through the contact form are delivered to the email address
# registered against this key (customercare@craftdyne.net).
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the value; .env is git-ignored.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
# Website visitor counter — free Redis database from https://console.upstash.com
# (Create database → REST API section). Used only by the /api/visitors function,
# never shipped to the browser. Without these, local dev uses an in-memory count
# and production hides the counter badge instead of showing a fake number.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
